## Architecture Notes (Quick Reference)

- **Two attendance systems:** Gate (`Attendance`/`Presence`) + Activity (`PresensiApel/Senam/Upacara`)
- **QR flow:** Student generates QR → staff camera POSTs to API → controller validates timing
- **4 roles:** admin(1), operator(2), user/student(3), pelatih(4)
- **Middleware:** `EnsureUserHasRole` as `role` alias; redirects on failure (not 403)
- **Frontend:** Tailwind v4, Alpine.js, Vite, Flowbite, html5-qrcode
- **Reports:** barryvdh/laravel-dompdf (PDF) + maatwebsite/excel (XLSX)
